<title>UK: BP sets Feb LPG price at $362/$244 a tonne.</title>
<headline>BP sets Feb LPG price at $362/$244 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum on Friday announced its official February price for Liquefied Petroleum Gas (LPG), the BP Agreed Price or BPAP, at $362 a tonne for propane and $244 for butane.</p>
<p>The prices are down from January's propane price of $367 a tonne and butane price of $273 a tonne.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
